{"zh":[{"start":8.19,"end":12.25,"text":"旁白：守护我们太阳系的……"},{"start":12.27,"end":16.32,"text":"是我们的恒星。"},{"start":16.34,"end":20.39,"text":"太阳提供了一道屏障，一直延伸到它轨道上"},{"start":20.41,"end":24.44,"text":"最后一颗行星之外：一个力场，挡开这些"},{"start":24.46,"end":28.48,"text":"「宇宙射线」。但这些"},{"start":28.5,"end":32.51,"text":"「太阳风」也可能很危险，"},{"start":32.53,"end":36.52,"text":"尤其是在叫做日冕物质抛射的爆发期间。"},{"start":36.54,"end":40.64,"text":"想看看地球出了问题会是什么样？"},{"start":40.66,"end":44.74,"text":"只要看看太阳风暴对我们的"},{"start":44.76,"end":48.84,"text":"姊妹行星金星做了什么。它们剥走了"},{"start":48.86,"end":52.92,"text":"它上层大气中的较轻元素：氢、氧，"},{"start":52.94,"end":57.0,"text":"以及它们组成的分子：水。"},{"start":57.02,"end":61.07,"text":"剩下的是一锅有毒的巫婆汤，"},{"start":61.09,"end":65.13,"text":"化学物质，包括浓厚的硫磺云。"},{"start":65.15,"end":69.18,"text":"地球是怎样躲过金星那样的悲惨命运的？"},{"start":69.2,"end":73.22,"text":"当太阳风暴逼近地球时，"},{"start":73.24,"end":77.24,"text":"我们就能看到答案。"},{"start":81.27,"end":85.36,"text":"我们的行星有一道自己的"},{"start":85.38,"end":89.47,"text":"防护罩——一个强大的磁场，"},{"start":89.49,"end":93.56,"text":"产生于它的核心深处。"},{"start":93.58,"end":97.65,"text":"其实，这只是我们的第一道"},{"start":97.67,"end":101.72,"text":"防线。穿过来的太阳能，很大一部分"},{"start":101.74,"end":105.79,"text":"被云、冰和雪反射回太空。"},{"start":105.81,"end":109.84,"text":"地球吸收的能量"},{"start":109.86,"end":113.88,"text":"刚好够驱动一台了不起的行星"},{"start":113.9,"end":117.9,"text":"引擎：气候。"},{"start":117.92,"end":121.91,"text":"它之所以运转起来，"},{"start":121.93,"end":125.99,"text":"是因为太阳加热不均匀，部分原因是"},{"start":126.01,"end":130.07,"text":"昼夜循环，还有季节，让温暖的"},{"start":130.09,"end":134.14,"text":"热带风吹向两极，寒冷的"},{"start":134.16,"end":138.2,"text":"极地空气吹向赤道。"},{"start":138.22,"end":142.26,"text":"风"},{"start":142.28,"end":146.3,"text":"推动海洋表层的洋流。"},{"start":146.32,"end":150.34,"text":"这段计算机模拟展示了"},{"start":150.36,"end":154.37,"text":"墨西哥湾流沿着北美海岸蜿蜒前进。"},{"start":166.5,"end":170.55,"text":"这条大洋之河携带的热能"},{"start":170.57,"end":174.62,"text":"足够驱动工业世界一百倍"},{"start":174.64,"end":178.67,"text":"还多。它会碎裂成"},{"start":178.69,"end":182.72,"text":"巨大的漩涡，把温暖的热带海水"},{"start":182.74,"end":186.77,"text":"散布到北方的海洋上。"},{"start":190.82,"end":194.82,"text":"在海面以下，它们混合"},{"start":194.84,"end":198.84,"text":"寒冷的深层洋流，这些洋流盘旋在"},{"start":198.86,"end":202.93,"text":"海底的岩架和山脉之下。"},{"start":223.3,"end":227.33,"text":"地球的气候引擎有无数运转的部件："},{"start":227.35,"end":231.36,"text":"潮汐和地形，侧风和洋流——"},{"start":231.38,"end":235.39,"text":"都在努力让全球的温度"},{"start":235.41,"end":239.4,"text":"趋于平衡。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":8.19,"end":12.25,"text":"Narrator: What safeguards our solar system...","words":[["Narrator:","旁白"],["What","什么"],["safeguards","守护"],["our","我们的"],["solar","太阳"],["system...","系…"]]},{"start":12.27,"end":16.32,"text":"is our star.","words":[["is","是"],["our","我们的"],["star.","恒星"]]},{"start":16.34,"end":20.39,"text":"The sun provides a shield, stretching beyond the last","words":[["The","这"],["sun","太阳"],["provides","提供"],["a","一个"],["shield,","屏障"],["stretching","延伸"],["beyond","超出"],["the","这"],["last","最后"]]},{"start":20.41,"end":24.44,"text":"planet in its orbit: a force field that deflects these","words":[["planet","行星"],["in","在"],["its","它的"],["orbit:","轨道"],["a","一个"],["force","力"],["field","场"],["that","那"],["deflects","偏转"],["these","这些"]]},{"start":24.46,"end":28.48,"text":"\"cosmic rays.\" But these","words":[["\"cosmic","“宇宙"],["rays.\"","射线”"],["But","但"],["these","这些"]]},{"start":28.5,"end":32.51,"text":"\"solar winds\" can be dangerous too,","words":[["\"solar","“太阳"],["winds\"","风”"],["can","能"],["be","是"],["dangerous","危险"],["too,","也"]]},{"start":32.53,"end":36.52,"text":"especially during outbursts called coronal mass ejections.","words":[["especially","尤其"],["during","在…期间"],["outbursts","爆发"],["called","叫做"],["coronal","日冕"],["mass","物质"],["ejections.","抛射"]]},{"start":36.54,"end":40.64,"text":"Want a vision of earth gone","words":[["Want","想要"],["a","一个"],["vision","景象"],["of","的"],["earth","地球"],["gone","变得"]]},{"start":40.66,"end":44.74,"text":"wrong? Just look at what solar storms do our","words":[["wrong?","坏了"],["Just","只"],["look","看"],["at","在"],["what","什么"],["solar","太阳"],["storms","风暴"],["do","对"],["our","我们的"]]},{"start":44.76,"end":48.84,"text":"sister planet, Venus. They strip away lighter","words":[["sister","姊妹"],["planet,","行星"],["Venus.","金星"],["They","它们"],["strip","剥"],["away","走"],["lighter","较轻的"]]},{"start":48.86,"end":52.92,"text":"elements in its upper atmosphere, hydrogen, oxygen","words":[["elements","元素"],["in","在"],["its","它的"],["upper","上层"],["atmosphere,","大气"],["hydrogen,","氢"],["oxygen","氧"]]},{"start":52.94,"end":57.0,"text":"and the molecule they form: water.","words":[["and","和"],["the","这"],["molecule","分子"],["they","它们"],["form:","组成"],["water.","水"]]},{"start":57.02,"end":61.07,"text":"What's left is a witch's brew of noxious","words":[["What's","什么"],["left","剩下的"],["is","是"],["a","一个"],["witch's","巫婆的"],["brew","汤"],["of","的"],["noxious","有毒"]]},{"start":61.09,"end":65.13,"text":"chemicals including thick sulfurous clouds.","words":[["chemicals","化学物质"],["including","包括"],["thick","浓厚的"],["sulfurous","含硫的"],["clouds.","云"]]},{"start":65.15,"end":69.18,"text":"How has Earth avoided the grim fate of Venus?","words":[["How","怎样"],["has","有"],["Earth","地球"],["avoided","躲过"],["the","这"],["grim","悲惨"],["fate","命运"],["of","的"],["Venus?","金星"]]},{"start":69.2,"end":73.22,"text":"We can see the answer as the solar storm","words":[["We","我们"],["can","能"],["see","看到"],["the","这"],["answer","答案"],["as","当"],["the","这"],["solar","太阳"],["storm","风暴"]]},{"start":73.24,"end":77.24,"text":"approaches Earth.","words":[["approaches","逼近"],["Earth.","地球"]]},{"start":81.27,"end":85.36,"text":"Our planet has a protective shield","words":[["Our","我们的"],["planet","行星"],["has","有"],["a","一个"],["protective","保护的"],["shield","屏障"]]},{"start":85.38,"end":89.47,"text":"all it's own-- A powerful magnetic field","words":[["all","全"],["it's","它"],["own--","自己的"],["A","一个"],["powerful","强大的"],["magnetic","磁"],["field","场"]]},{"start":89.49,"end":93.56,"text":"generated deep within its core.","words":[["generated","产生"],["deep","深"],["within","在…内"],["its","它的"],["core.","核心"]]},{"start":93.58,"end":97.65,"text":"In fact, that's just our first line of","words":[["In","事实"],["fact,","上"],["that's","那是"],["just","只"],["our","我们的"],["first","第一"],["line","道"],["of","的"]]},{"start":97.67,"end":101.72,"text":"defense. Much of the solar energy that gets through","words":[["defense.","防线"],["Much","大部分"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["solar","太阳"],["energy","能量"],["that","那"],["gets","穿"],["through","过"]]},{"start":101.74,"end":105.79,"text":"is reflected back to space by clouds, ice,","words":[["is","是"],["reflected","反射"],["back","回"],["to","到"],["space","太空"],["by","被"],["clouds,","云"],["ice,","冰"]]},{"start":105.81,"end":109.84,"text":"and snow. The energy that Earth absorbs","words":[["and","和"],["snow.","雪"],["The","这"],["energy","能量"],["that","那"],["Earth","地球"],["absorbs","吸收"]]},{"start":109.86,"end":113.88,"text":"is just enough to power a remarkable planetary","words":[["is","是"],["just","刚好"],["enough","足够"],["to","去"],["power","驱动"],["a","一台"],["remarkable","了不起的"],["planetary","行星"]]},{"start":113.9,"end":117.9,"text":"engine: the climate.","words":[["engine:","引擎"],["the","这"],["climate.","气候"]]},{"start":117.92,"end":121.91,"text":"It's set in motion","words":[["It's","它是"],["set","设"],["in","在"],["motion","运转"]]},{"start":121.93,"end":125.99,"text":"by the unevenness of solar heating, due in part to the","words":[["by","由"],["the","这"],["unevenness","不均匀"],["of","的"],["solar","太阳"],["heating,","加热"],["due","由于"],["in","在"],["part","部分"],["to","于"],["the","这"]]},{"start":126.01,"end":130.07,"text":"cycles of day and night, and the seasons that cause warm","words":[["cycles","循环"],["of","的"],["day","白天"],["and","和"],["night,","夜晚"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["seasons","季节"],["that","那"],["cause","使"],["warm","温暖"]]},{"start":130.09,"end":134.14,"text":"tropical winds to blow toward the poles and cold","words":[["tropical","热带"],["winds","风"],["to","去"],["blow","吹"],["toward","向"],["the","这"],["poles","两极"],["and","和"],["cold","寒冷"]]},{"start":134.16,"end":138.2,"text":"polar air toward the equator.","words":[["polar","极地"],["air","空气"],["toward","向"],["the","这"],["equator.","赤道"]]},{"start":138.22,"end":142.26,"text":"Wind currents","words":[["Wind","风"],["currents","流"]]},{"start":142.28,"end":146.3,"text":"drive surface ocean currents.","words":[["drive","推动"],["surface","表层"],["ocean","海洋"],["currents.","洋流"]]},{"start":146.32,"end":150.34,"text":"This computer simulation shows the","words":[["This","这个"],["computer","计算机"],["simulation","模拟"],["shows","展示"],["the","这"]]},{"start":150.36,"end":154.37,"text":"Gulf Stream winding its way along the coast of North America.","words":[["Gulf","墨西哥湾"],["Stream","流"],["winding","蜿蜒"],["its","它的"],["way","路"],["along","沿着"],["the","这"],["coast","海岸"],["of","的"],["North","北"],["America.","美洲"]]},{"start":166.5,"end":170.55,"text":"This great ocean river carries enough heat energy","words":[["This","这"],["great","巨大"],["ocean","海洋"],["river","河流"],["carries","携带"],["enough","足够"],["heat","热"],["energy","能量"]]},{"start":170.57,"end":174.62,"text":"to power the industrial world a hundred times","words":[["to","去"],["power","驱动"],["the","这"],["industrial","工业"],["world","世界"],["a","一"],["hundred","百"],["times","倍"]]},{"start":174.64,"end":178.67,"text":"over. It breaks down","words":[["over.","有余"],["It","它"],["breaks","碎"],["down","裂"]]},{"start":178.69,"end":182.72,"text":"in massive world pools that spread warm tropical","words":[["in","在"],["massive","巨大的"],["world","漩"],["pools","涡"],["that","那"],["spread","散布"],["warm","温暖的"],["tropical","热带"]]},{"start":182.74,"end":186.77,"text":"waters over northern seas.","words":[["waters","水"],["over","在…上"],["northern","北方的"],["seas.","海洋"]]},{"start":190.82,"end":194.82,"text":"Below the surface they mix","words":[["Below","在…下面"],["the","这"],["surface","表面"],["they","它们"],["mix","混合"]]},{"start":194.84,"end":198.84,"text":"with cold deep currents that swirl around","words":[["with","与"],["cold","寒冷的"],["deep","深层"],["currents","洋流"],["that","那"],["swirl","盘旋"],["around","周围"]]},{"start":198.86,"end":202.93,"text":"under sea ledges and mountains.","words":[["under","在…下"],["sea","海"],["ledges","岩架"],["and","和"],["mountains.","山脉"]]},{"start":223.3,"end":227.33,"text":"Earth's climate engine has countless moving parts:","words":[["Earth's","地球的"],["climate","气候"],["engine","引擎"],["has","有"],["countless","无数"],["moving","运动的"],["parts:","部件"]]},{"start":227.35,"end":231.36,"text":"tides and terrain, cross winds and currents--","words":[["tides","潮汐"],["and","和"],["terrain,","地形"],["cross","侧"],["winds","风"],["and","和"],["currents--","洋流—"]]},{"start":231.38,"end":235.39,"text":"all working to equalize temperatures around","words":[["all","全都"],["working","努力"],["to","去"],["equalize","平衡"],["temperatures","温度"],["around","遍及"]]},{"start":235.41,"end":239.4,"text":"the globe.","words":[["the","这"],["globe.","全球"]]}]}